Bab 14 Analisis Data dan Big Data dalam E-Commerce
Bab 15 Internasionalisasi dan Globalisasi E-Commerce
Bab 16 Trend Masa Depan E-Commerrce},
	author = {Menarianti, Ika and Rahmanto, Basuki and Wijayanti, Anita and Sungkawati, Endang and Bintari, Wisang and Komariyah, Erna and Anindhita, Mutia and Ngga'a, Christin and Hapsara, Osrita and Prasetya, Prita and Imron, Ali and Wardhana, Aditya and Prameswari, Fanniya and Yanti, Sur and Anugrah, Roy and Abdurohim, Abdurohim},
